  "input": {
    "exactText": "SECTION  6.02 Liens. \n Create, incur, assume, or permit to exist, directly or indirectly, any Lien on or with respect to any of its assets, of any kind, whether now\nowned or hereafter acquired, or any income or profits therefrom, except for Permitted Liens (including Liens that are replacements of Permitted Liens to the extent that the original Indebtedness is refinanced, renewed, replaced or extended under\n Section  6.01(d) and so long as the replacement Liens only encumber those assets that secured the refinanced, renewed, or extended Indebtedness). \n ",
